    "body": "The HTML spec unfortunately has silly hard-wrapping rules which make small changes like this a pain. https://output.jsbin.com/maferi can do the wrapping for you. In this case, the paragraph would be:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  <p>Each <code>EventTarget</code> object that has one or more <span>event handlers</span> specified\r\n  has an associated <dfn export>event handler map</dfn>, which is a <span data-x=\"ordered\r\n  map\">map</span> of strings representing <span data-x=\"event handler name\">names</span> of\r\n  <span>event handlers</span> to <span>event handlers</span>.</p>\r\n```\r\n\r\n(sorry, GitHub doesn't allow me to make this as an easy-to-commit suggestion)",
